commit 387315c8ecfa2c7ac6f397415e41c2a7357785bf
Author: ledger <ledger@example.invalid>
Date:   Mon Nov 23 01:38:11 2026 +0000

    Add a tasks board, grouped by the Thursday each task is due by
    
    The kit gains a week mode: open tasks past their due date sit at the top under
    Overdue (the date-based fold would have hidden them), done ones go under a fold.
    Columns can format dates and take a prefix. The events page builds unchanged.
    
    Data from incoming/tasks.csv with the polytunnel rota columns left out (they are
    a separate list, not part of each task), qty merged into notes, and two typos
    fixed (Done, priya).
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

